## 4. Comprehensive Feature List

### 4.1 Playback, Audio Engine & Cache
* **Direct FLAC Streaming & Transcoding (`q`):** Stream uncompressed FLAC or cycle quality profiles (320k / 192k / 96k MP3/Opus) on metered networks.
* **Dual-Tier Cache Engine:**
  * **Rolling LRU Cache:** Automatically buffers active playback streams to `~/.cache/loxia/tracks/` with auto-eviction at a user-defined max limit (e.g., 5 GB).
  * **Permanent Downloads (`d`):** Pins tracks, albums, or playlists to permanent storage (`~/.local/share/loxia/downloads/`) for full offline listening.
* **0ms Gapless & Crossfading (0–10s):** Support for gapless transitions or smooth volume crossfading between tracks.
* **Bit-Perfect Hardware Mode (`Ctrl + B`):** Passthrough locking ALSA, WASAPI Exclusive, or CoreAudio directly.
* **Audio Device Quick-Picker (`Shift + O`):** Instant modal to hot-swap physical output devices mid-song.
* **10-Band Graphic Equalizer (`e`):** Live ISO frequency tuning (31Hz to 16kHz) with factory presets and custom user profile saving.
* **Smart ReplayGain Normalization (`r`):** Switchable between **Album Mode**, **Track Mode**, and **Off**.

### 4.2 Queue, Selection, History & Playlists
* **Session State Persistence:** Automatically saves play queue, track position, active tab, and shuffle state on exit (`~/.local/state/loxia/session.json`) and restores them on launch.
* **Visual Multi-Select Mode (`v` / `Space`):** Vim-style selection mode to highlight multiple non-sequential tracks for bulk queueing (`a`), play-next insertion (`n`), or playlist assignment (`Ctrl + P`).
* **Listening History (`h` inside Now Playing):** Sub-view tracking the last 50 played tracks with playback timestamps.
* **Favourites Tab (`Alt + 2`):** Direct browsing view for starred Artists, Albums, and Tracks.
* **Save Queue / Selection to Playlist (`Shift + P` / `Ctrl + P`):** Export active queue or highlighted items directly to Emby playlists.
* **Non-Destructive Shuffle / Unshuffle (`s`):** Permutes upcoming queue without altering current track or losing original un-shuffled state.
* **Multi-Criteria Sort Profiles (`o`):** Stack up to 4 criteria rules (`Name`, `Artist`, `Album Artist`, `Album`, `Year`, `Track #`, `Genre`, `Date Added`) with independent `ASC`/`DESC` directions.

### 4.3 Discovery, Interface & Aesthetics
* **Universal Help Modal (`?`):** Context-aware keyboard cheat sheet overlay.
* **Full Terminal Mouse Support:** Click seekbar to skip track position, scroll trackpad through lists/columns, and click tabs/items.
* **Desktop Toast Notifications:** Native OS pop-ups (`notify-rust`) on track change displaying track name, artist, album, and thumbnail.
* **Direct Tab Jumps (`Alt + 1` .. `Alt + 9`):** Jump instantly to any left sidebar navigation tab.
* **Zen Focus Mode (`z`):** Minimalist view with high-res artwork (Kitty/Sixel), lyrics, progress metrics, and ASCII spectrum analyzer.
* **7 Visual Themes:** `default_terminal` (transparent/ANSI), `far_blue`, `darcula`, `cyberpunk_neon`, `amber_crt`, `green_crt`, and `oled_black`.

### 4.4 System Integration, Network & Offline Resiliency
* **Offline Scrobble Sync Buffer:** Caches playback events locally during network dropouts, auto-syncing play counts to Emby once reconnected.
* **Multi-Server Profile Support:** Store and switch between multiple Emby server configurations.
* **Arbitrary Custom Headers:** Injects custom HTTP headers (`CF-Access-Client-Id`, custom tokens, etc.) into every REST request and WebSocket stream.
* **In-UI Keybinding Remapper:** Remap any action directly within the UI with conflict detection.
* **Cross-Platform Media Keys (`souvlaki`):** Hardware media key integration (MPRIS2, SMTC, CoreAudio).

